  "constitutionalInvariants": [
    "ThriveEvergreen may optimize within authority. It may never manufacture authority.",
    "Every valid economic evaluation resolves to exact-version ECAC, HOLD, or DENY.",
    "Provider success is evidence and never independently creates CrownThrive economic truth.",
    "ML output is advisory only and cannot issue ECAC or cause an economic effect.",
    "D3 is human reserved.",
    "Generalized external thriveevergreen.publish.dispatch remains disabled and HOLD.",
    "Consequential mutations require idempotency, pre-read, second-read, post-read, and rollback or compensation evidence."
